simple prototypes, nothing

00:09:11.850 --> 00:09:16.180
that fancy by today's standards,
but then it just organically

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:16.680
grew.

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:19.170
So I was like in sports--

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:22.080
some of my favorite people I
follow in the sports world,

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.160
they all lead by example.

00:09:23.160 --> 00:09:25.533
They're not going to shout
at the teammates about,

00:09:25.533 --> 00:09:27.450
oh, you did bad or this
is what we need to do.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.670
They just go and do
it, and then they

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:30.910
bring people along the way.

00:09:30.910 --> 00:09:34.008
So I took a calculated risk.

00:09:34.008 --> 00:09:35.550
At the time I was
sewing on, I didn't

00:09:35.550 --> 00:09:38.520
realize how risky it was
until after the fact,

00:09:38.520 --> 00:09:40.150
but it ended up working.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:42.990
So I think leading
by example and trying

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:46.260
to get some examples
to leadership of like,

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:48.100
this is what is possible.

00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:50.370
But in order to
make this happen,

00:09:50.370 --> 00:09:53.130
